st -count=1 ./.... Structural HTML inspection reports 42 rows, five headers, zero groups, six thread rows, six rails, one script and zero external-resource elements. The browser-control runtime remained unavailable in this session, so this approval does not claim a pixel screenshot; DOM structure, CSS geometry, content and interaction code were inspected directly. Design only; do not merge before hugh ratifies.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:3ccdd5dcbe84115366db3025186394278522d2b8","head":"e1fd9eb679f8ac7e30c4421871d3fe5dbbff9695","verdict":"approved"}}